  "goodToKnow": "Die Arbeitsgemeinschaft (AG) is a working group or consortium. At German schools, AGs are voluntary after-school clubs: die Schach-AG, die Chor-AG. Germany's first public TV channel, Das Erste, is run by the ARD, the Arbeitsgemeinschaft der öffentlich-rechtlichen Rundfunkanstalten der Bundesrepublik Deutschland, one of the longest names in German broadcasting. Careful: after a company name, AG means Aktiengesellschaft."
